# The build context is the repo root, and `target/` is several gigabytes of
# host-built artefacts the image must never see — sending it costs minutes, and
# a stale host artefact leaking into a container build is a class of bug that
# takes a day to find.
target/
.git/
.github/
docs/
deploy/
bench/target/
*.md
chain.jsonl
tampered.jsonl
